[[Lowland Shore Renown Token]]s are [[trophy]] items rewarded by completing events outside of the [[Renown Heart]] areas across the [[Lowland Shore]] zone. They can be traded in to the Lowland Shore [[Renown Heart NPC]]s for a [[Local Writ of Renown]], granting 20% instant progress towards the heart completion (25% with the [[Acceptance of the Kodan]] mastery). Renown Tokens serve as a supplement and an alternative to completing Renown Hearts directly (achieved by doing their nearby tasks and events), primarily for the achievements in the [[Renown Hearts (achievements)|Renown Hearts]] and [[Repeatable]] categories. The renown heart must have been already completed on a previous day on that character to have access to the vendor. 

